    "message": "  Version 10.2.0 throws ArgumentException in valid configurations: (1) when\n  reusing a pre-existing container whose partition key path differs from the\n  one in settings, and (2) at startup when a partition key path segment cannot\n  be matched to a C# property on the entity. Both are fixed in 10.2.1, which is\n  API-compatible with 10.2.0 — just upgrade to 10.2.1 or later.",
    "reasons": [
      "CriticalBugs"
    ]
  },
  "description": "Generic repository base class for Azure Cosmos DB, implementing the repository pattern from Infrastructure.Data.Abstractions. Supports CosmosClient injection, automatic database and container creation, and overridable protected methods for easy customization and unit testing.",
